  "description": "NimbleMock is a zero-allocation, source-generated mocking library for .NET. 34x faster than Moq and 7x faster than NSubstitute in mock creation. Features: fluent API, partial mocks, static/sealed mocking, full async/ValueTask support, generic type inference, compile-time analyzers, and lie-proofing against real APIs.",
